a.jpg"}], "slug": "among-space", "storyline": "The year is 2039. Humanity is actively colonizing planets beyond our Solar System. Your squad was assigned to investigate anomalies hindering colonization efforts.\nEverything went wrong when an unknown lifeform attacked your expedition. In panic, the crew rushed to the escape pods. Everyone knew one pod was damaged. Everyone except you... Now it's just you and your AI assistant Neutrino in this alien world. Will you find the path to survival?", "summary": "Among Space is a horror game set on the planet EC-10013. You are a researcher of the anomalies of the planet, you were abandoned by your \"comrades\" during an emergency evacuation. Will you be able to leave the planet or will you find another way to survive?", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/among-space"}